          "value": "<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Check out these bugs I found under a rotten log in the graveyard! I’ve never seen bugs like this before. They’re so awesome. I don’t know which is my favorite. I really like the green and blue ones, but I also like the green and pink ones. My pockets are full of 'em! I also saw a hand coming out of the ground under the log. It didn’t have much skin, but the fingers started moving. Cool, right?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Wooden Cyclops\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Eldritch Evolution\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Giant Adephage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Noxious Revival\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Grist, the Hunger Tide\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest"
